 "name_en": "Rework Processing – Stock-Manufactured Material (BJN)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Rework Processing – Stock-Manufactured Material (BJN)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiodd11fe15a56240af9d9f7358cfde3c61\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiodd11fe15a56240af9d9f7358cfde3c61__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item focuses on rework activities and material postings after production execution for the original material (including goods receipt for the product), with an additional rework production order. Issues with the produced material are monitored after it is posted to inventory.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The rework process of stock-manufactured materials begins with the creation of a new production order. This is done using the material to be reworked as both input and output.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Costs are listed in the new production order, and are settled within controlling as production variants. The input component and product have the same material number.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiodd11fe15a56240af9d9f7358cfde3c61__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create rework production order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Release rework production order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Issue goods for defective material including printing preview</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Confirm rework production activities</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods receipt for rework production order incl. printing preview</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiodd11fe15a56240af9d9f7358cfde3c61__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Show transparent costs for rework activities</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use all standard shop-floor control functionalities</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve usability with intuitive confirmation of production operations</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>返工处理 - 库存制造物料 (BJN)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiodd11fe15a56240af9d9f7358cfde3c61\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiodd11fe15a56240af9d9f7358cfde3c61__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目侧重于使用附加返工生产订单对原始物料（包括产品的收货）执行生产后的返工活动和物料过账。生产物料的发货过账到库存后进行监控。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">库存制造物料的返工流程从创建新的生产订单开始。使用要返工的物料作为输入和输出完成此操作。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">成本在新生产订单中列出，并在成本控制中作为生产变式结算。输入组件和产品具有相同的物料编号。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiodd11fe15a56240af9d9f7358cfde3c61__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建返工生产订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">下达返工生产订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">缺陷物料的发货（包括打印预览）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确认返工生产活动</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账返工生产订单的收货，包括打印预览</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiodd11fe15a56240af9d9f7358cfde3c61__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">显示返工活动的透明成本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用所有标准车间控制功能</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过直观的生产操作确认提高可用性</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
